A solution is 10\% in mass and its solute has a MW of 100g/mol. Calculate:
\begin{inparaenum}[(a)]
\item the mole fraction of the solution if it's a water-based solution  % 0.02
\item the mole fraction of the solution if it's an ethanol-based solution and ethanol's MW is  32g/mol % 0.03
\end{inparaenum} 
